{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43290","headline":"戛玉有余声 · 管雄甫","name":"戛玉有余声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戛玉音难尽，凝人思转清。\n依稀流户牖，髣髴在檐楹。\n更逐松风起，还将涧水幷。\n乐中和旧曲，天际转余声。\n漂渺浮烟远，温柔入耳轻。\n想如君子佩，时得上堂鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"管雄甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}